{"id":"n24876-1-7","stage":3,"title":"장식 · 装饰","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24876-1-7-1","ko":"이번 연극의 배경은 숲이지?","zh":"这次戏剧的背景是森林，对吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"연극의","meaning":"话剧，戏剧","explanation":"연극：话剧，戏剧；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"연극","audio":"/audio/ca8deda3ff79221b26a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13977","senseId":"1","lemma":"연극","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연극의","audio":"/audio/8fcdbebea3da72760156.mp3"}},{"text":"배경은","meaning":"背景","explanation":"배경：背景；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"배경","audio":"/audio/d643b25289201a43324e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62538","senseId":"4","lemma":"배경","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배경은","audio":"/audio/611cb577e58ab6dea3f0.mp3"}},{"text":"숲이지?","meaning":"树林","explanation":"숲：树林；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"숲","audio":"/audio/d862def644e3210687f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62457","senseId":"1","lemma":"숲","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"숲이지","audio":"/audio/bbfcb68d2bd2cf080ace.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"ca8deda3ff79221b","term":"연극","zh":"话剧，戏剧","audio":"/audio/ca8deda3ff79221b26a4.mp3","entryId":"13977","definition":"演员在舞台上照着剧本向观众展示演技的行为。","pronunciation":["연ː극"]},{"id":"d643b25289201a43","term":"배경","zh":"背景","audio":"/audio/d643b25289201a43324e.mp3","entryId":"62538","definition":"在文学作品中，时间、空间、社会方面的环境。","pronunciation":["배ː경"]},{"id":"d862def644e32106","term":"숲","zh":"树林","audio":"/audio/d862def644e3210687f7.mp3","entryId":"62457","definition":"树或草茂密生长的地方。","pronunciation":["숩"]}],"audio":"/audio/10b3c7875cbdbe5b4ddf.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24876-1-7-2","ko":"응. 무대 장식은 꽃하고 나무로 하면 될 것 같아.","zh":"嗯。舞台装饰用花和树应该就够了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"무대","meaning":"舞台","explanation":"무대：舞台","readings":[{"term":"무대","audio":"/audio/64389d2db12c00f1176e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15524","senseId":"1","lemma":"무대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무대","audio":"/audio/64389d2db12c00f1176e.mp3"}},{"text":"장식은","meaning":"装饰，装扮，点缀","explanation":"장식：装饰，装扮，点缀；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"장식","audio":"/audio/7eff51ccc645178ec1e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24876","senseId":"1","lemma":"장식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장식은","audio":"/audio/26676188a40ad1e4dd84.mp3"}},{"text":"꽃하고","meaning":"花，花朵","explanation":"꽃：花，花朵；하고：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"꽃","audio":"/audio/1543c99e8fd9f44ded8e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62838","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽃","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꽃하고","audio":"/audio/23c7788b7c884b64430d.mp3"}},{"text":"나무로","meaning":"树，树木","explanation":"나무：树，树木；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"나무","audio":"/audio/b294b251f77dfbc5ede4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32750","senseId":"1","lemma":"나무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나무로","audio":"/audio/02203b49539fe7bfd59c.mp3"}},{"text":"하면","meaning":"做，作，置办","explanation":"하다：做，作，置办；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하면","audio":"/audio/01692c67203f44175054.mp3"}},{"text":"될","meaning":"做成，用……做","explanation":"되다：做成，用……做；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"9","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"될","audio":"/audio/dc84eeabbbd47f74f20a.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"64389d2db12c00f1","term":"무대","zh":"舞台","audio":"/audio/64389d2db12c00f1176e.mp3","entryId":"15524","definition":"为了表演戏剧、舞蹈、音乐等，在观众席前建造的高于观众席的宽大台子。","pronunciation":["무ː대"]},{"id":"7eff51ccc645178e","term":"장식","zh":"装饰，装扮，点缀","audio":"/audio/7eff51ccc645178ec1e3.mp3","entryId":"24876","definition":"布置得好看；或指用于装饰的物品。","pronunciation":["장식"]},{"id":"1543c99e8fd9f44d","term":"꽃","zh":"花，花朵","audio":"/audio/1543c99e8fd9f44ded8e.mp3","entryId":"62838","definition":"长在植物茎干顶端的一部分，具有特有的模样、颜色和香气；或指会开此物的植物。","pronunciation":["꼳"]},{"id":"b294b251f77dfbc5","term":"나무","zh":"树，树木","audio":"/audio/b294b251f77dfbc5ede4.mp3","e